    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Some products should only sell in minimums, caps or packs. Quantity Min/Max &amp; Step Rules enforces those constraints both on the product page quantity selector and when items are added to or updated in the cart.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum, maximum and step (multiples-of) quantities, store-wide.</li>\n<li>Enforced on the product input and at cart validation.</li>\n<li>Lightweight, HPOS-ready, no jQuery.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> and activate.</li>\n<li>Go to WooCommerce <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Settings <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Quantity Rules and set your limits.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix: quantity min/max/step rules are now enforced on the Cart block, Checkout block and Mini-Cart block (WooCommerce Store API), not just the classic cart/checkout.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release. Store-wide min / max / step quantity enforcement.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Enforce minimum, maximum and step (multiples-of) order quantities — perfect for wholesale and case-pack selling.",
    "description": "<p>Some products should only sell in minimums, caps or packs. Quantity Min/Max &amp; Step Rules enforces those constraints both on the product page quantity selector and when items are added to or updated in the cart.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Minimum, maximum and step (multiples-of) quantities, store-wide.</li>\n<li>Enforced on the product input and at cart validation.</li>\n<li>Lightweight, HPOS-ready, no jQuery.</li>\n</ul>\n",
